OL,3,GNorth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FLow cloud in the north slowly
OL,6,Flifts through the day but some spots
OL,7,Fof rain, chiefly across the higher
OL,8,Fparts of Cumbria. Possible brighter
OL,9,Fspells in the south later. Feeling
OL,10,Fwarm for September with light winds.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FMostly dry this evening and
OL,13,Fovernight with variable amounts of
OL,14,Fcloud, some clear spells. Thicker
OL,15,Fcloud arrives across the north of the
OL,16,Fregion towards dawn with outbreaks of
OL,17,Fheavy rain.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
