OL,3,GNorth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CWednesday:FOvercast with outbreaks of
OL,6,Fheavy and persistent rain,
OL,7,Fparticularly across the hills and
OL,8,Fmountains. Becoming drier and brighter
OL,9,Ffrom the west during the afternoon.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Thursday to Saturday:FDrier
OL,12,Fand brighter on Thursday before
OL,13,Fanother band of rain moves into the
OL,14,Fnorthwest into Friday. This clearing
OL,15,Fsouthwards on Saturday. Average
OL,16,Ftemperatures by day but chilly at
OL,17,Fnight.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
